1
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:07,760
要命
Oh, boy.

2
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:10,560
又到了牲口拍賣季的第一天了嗎
Is it already the first day of livestock auction season again?

3
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:12,100
每年都是同一天啊 米奇爾
It's the same day every year, Mitchell --

4
00:00:12,117 --> 00:00:14,067
第一顆番茄成熟后的第十五天
a fortnight after the first ripe tomato comes in.

5
00:00:14,067 --> 00:00:14,747
而且說真的
And seriously?

6
00:00:14,747 --> 00:00:17,036
現在的拍賣叫價都這么業余了嗎
This is what passes for auction-calling these days?

7
00:00:17,036 --> 00:00:19,306
你會不會太嚴苛了一點
Is it possible you're being a tad harsh?

8
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:21,200
當你曾經是某個領域的頂尖人物
You know, when you've been at the top of your field --

9
00:00:21,216 --> 00:00:23,016
大巴格縣拍賣叫價冠軍
Greater Bug County Auction-Calling Champ

10
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:23,960
還連續贏了三年
three years running --

11
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:26,100
那你眼里就只能看到缺點和不足
it's hard to see anything but the inadequacies.

12
00:00:26,106 --> 00:00:28,056
所以巴瑞辛尼科夫才沒法觀看其他舞蹈
It's why Baryshnikov couldn't watch others dance.

13
00:00:28,056 --> 00:00:30,276
什么 他明明擔任過藝術總監...
What? He was the Artistic Director of --

14
00:00:30,276 --> 00:00:31,943
你都在這房子里住了多久了
How long have you lived in this house?!

15
00:00:31,943 --> 00:00:34,405
最后你會發現是一頭叫巴瑞辛尼科夫的豬
It's gonna wind up being some pig named Baryshnikov

16
00:00:34,405 --> 00:00:35,706
或叫其他鬼名字的
or some damn thing.

17
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,160
你的小號課上得怎么樣了
So, how was your trumpet lesson?

18
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:39,780
太美妙了
It was amazing. Yeah.

19
00:00:39,815 --> 00:00:42,875
那些課程[療程]真的改變了我的人生
Oh, these sessions just have really changed my life.

20
00:00:43,245 --> 00:00:45,125
嚴格來說 我沒說謊
Technically, uh, not a lie.

21
00:00:45,125 --> 00:00:47,855
我從兩年前開始上小號課
Uh, I started taking trumpet lessons two years ago.

22
00:00:47,855 --> 00:00:49,554
但之后我發現隔壁店的按摩
But then I noticed the place next door

23
00:00:49,554 --> 00:00:52,474
跟課程同樣價格 于是...
was offering massages for the same price, so...

24
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:53,780
你懂的
you know.

25
00:00:54,394 --> 00:00:57,434
我很內疚 自己去放松 而小卡...
And I felt bad relaxing while Cam was...

26
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,580
一個人照顧莉莉
solo-parenting Lily.

27
00:00:58,694 --> 00:01:01,284
但話說回來 我倆都是跟一個
But -- But we were both spending time

28
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:03,180
亞洲女性共處 讓她踩背[羞辱]
with an Asian woman who walked all over us.

29
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:05,040
你每次從那里回來
You always smell like lavender

30
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,080
身上都有薰衣草的味道
when you come back from that place.

31
00:01:06,213 --> 00:01:08,113
那個是 是閥鍵油
Uh, yeah, it's the -- it's the valve oil

32
00:01:08,113 --> 00:01:08,883
上在...你知道
for the, um -- you know,

33
00:01:08,883 --> 00:01:10,492
就是上在... 小號的按鍵里
the t-- the tooting buttons.

34
00:01:10,553 --> 00:01:12,153
我們該盡快出發了
We should probably, uh, hit the road soon.

35
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:13,600
一小時后就要舉行高中畢業典禮了
High school graduation's in an hour.

36
00:01:14,023 --> 00:01:15,313
好丟臉啊
It's so humiliating

37
00:01:15,313 --> 00:01:17,293
以副校長身份出席這種活動
being the Vice Principal at these things.

38
00:01:17,293 --> 00:01:18,773
這只是象征性的地位
It's just a ceremonial position

39
00:01:18,773 --> 00:01:21,083
其實我只是坐在布朗校長身后
where you have to sit behind Principal Brown,

40
00:01:21,083 --> 00:01:22,002
禮貌地鼓掌
politely clapping

41
00:01:22,002 --> 00:01:24,252
眼看他設定歷史的進程
while he gets to set the course of history.

42
00:01:24,252 --> 00:01:25,712
不過我爸要在畢業典禮上致辭
Well, it could be fun with my dad giving

43
00:01:25,712 --> 00:01:26,962
應該會很有意思
the commencement address, though.

44
00:01:26,962 --> 00:01:28,192
我偷瞄了他的備忘卡
I got a peek at his note cards,

45
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,700
我不想劇透里面的內容
and I don't want to give anything away,

46
00:01:29,942 --> 00:01:31,662
但是那個頭上涂滿發蠟
but the young kid who boarded the bus

47
00:01:31,662 --> 00:01:32,882
手提著紙板行李箱
with the hair full of Brylcreem

48
00:01:32,882 --> 00:01:34,822
懷揣著夢想登上大巴的年輕孩子
and a cardboard suitcase full of dreams --

49
00:01:34,822 --> 00:01:35,903
是他
it was him.

50
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:38,840
我得接一下電話 是地方教育局長皮爾斯
Oh, I have to take this. It's Superintendent Pierce.

51
00:01:40,060 --> 00:01:42,440
您好 先生 真榮幸 請問有什么事
Hello, good sir. To what do I owe this honor?

52
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:44,840
不會吧
Oh, no.

53
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:46,800
太可怕了
That's horrible.

54
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:49,460
布朗校長出車禍啦
Principal Brown got into a car accident!

55
00:01:50,231 --> 00:01:52,731
也就是說 作為第二順位的校領導
W-Which means, as next in the line of succession,

56
00:01:52,731 --> 00:01:54,770
我可以主持今天的畢業典禮
I get to preside over today's graduation.

57
00:01:54,770 --> 00:01:57,140
這就是為什么高級行政官員
You know, this is why senior administration officials

58
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,100
從來不一起出行
never travel together.

59
00:01:59,470 --> 00:02:02,440
別人倒霉你卻幸災樂禍 我本該覺得不好
Your glee at another man's misfortune should trouble me,

60
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:04,900
但你這副樣子又有點性感
but there's also something sort of sexy about it.

61
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:06,260
權力就是春藥
Well, power is an aphrodisiac.

62
00:02:06,630 --> 00:02:08,510
或許晚點你可以扮演校長
Maybe later you could be the principal

63
00:02:08,510 --> 00:02:10,879
而我扮演還差了幾個學分的學生
and I could be the student who's a few credits short.

64
00:02:10,899 --> 00:02:12,279
我不乖
Hmm. A bad, bad boy

65
00:02:12,279 --> 00:02:14,119
需要被好好調教
who needs to be taught right from wrong.

66
00:02:14,119 --> 00:02:15,699
因為我成長于一個破碎家庭
'Cause I grew up in a broken home,

67
00:02:15,699 --> 00:02:18,739
社工常來我家 父母總為錢爭吵
where social workers and constant fights about money

68
00:02:18,739 --> 00:02:19,359
所以...
were just --

69
00:02:19,359 --> 00:02:21,009
算了 這編到我開始感覺難受了
Okay, well, now I'm just sad.

70
00:02:37,458 --> 00:02:38,438
我們能換位子嗎
Can we switch seats?

71
00:02:38,438 --> 00:02:39,518
我剛好坐在通風口下面
I'm right under a vent.

72
00:02:39,700 --> 00:02:41,000
這對我的喉嚨不好
This is not good for my instrument.

73
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:45,200
你這么認真對待這次致辭 真好啊
Oh, so nice that you're taking this speech so seriously.

74
00:02:45,237 --> 00:02:47,567
你當年為米奇和小卡的婚禮祝酒時
When you did Mitch and Cam's wedding toast,

75
00:02:47,567 --> 00:02:49,787
嘴里還塞滿了腰果呢
you had your mouth full of cashews.

76
00:02:52,577 --> 00:02:54,717
注意看你弟弟啊
Hey, pay attention to your brother.

77
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,080
是你讓他開始練空手道的
You got him into karate.

78
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:57,300
我不是故意的
Not on purpose.

79
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,220
我只是給他看了幾部《粉紅豹》的卡通電影
I just showed him a few "Pink Panther" movies.

80
00:03:00,620 --> 00:03:00,940
喬
Joe?

81
00:03:02,380 --> 00:03:02,860
喬
Joe?

82
00:03:03,026 --> 00:03:03,866
我不想再玩
I-I-I don't want to play

83
00:03:03,866 --> 00:03:06,596
妙探長克魯索和卡托的游戲了
this Inspector Clouseau and Cato game anymore.

84
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:08,520
我可不是害怕哦
It's not that I'm scared.

85
00:03:08,666 --> 00:03:10,676
我只是 有點忙
It's just, I-I'm a little busy --

86
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:13,320
他就是個小變態[《驚魂記》]
He's a little psycho.

87
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:15,160
對了 千萬別給他看這部電影
Which we must never show him, by the way.

88
00:03:15,180 --> 00:03:17,660
如果我看起來心神不寧 抱歉
And sorry if I'm distracted.

89
00:03:18,180 --> 00:03:19,540
今天是加州藝術學院的裁生日
It's cut day at CalArts.

90
00:03:19,780 --> 00:03:21,420
我有一半同學都沒被叫回去繼續讀
Half of the class isn't being asked back.

91
00:03:21,475 --> 00:03:23,315
曼尼 母親的直覺告訴我
Manny, my mother's intuition

92
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,740
你沒什么好擔心的
tells me that you have nothing to worry about.

93
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:27,160
真的太殘酷了
It's just so cruel.

94
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:29,100
我還有一半課程就能拿到劇本創作學位
I'm halfway to a playwriting degree

95
00:03:30,265 --> 00:03:31,685
難道他們要就這樣把我趕去街頭嗎
and they're just gonna throw me out on the street

96
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:32,860
我都沒法養活自己
with no way to support myself?

97
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:35,680
正如一個睿智的男人在兩小時后要說的那樣
As a wise man will say in about two hours --

98
00:03:36,084 --> 00:03:39,634
"生活把石頭滾到你的道路前 你要心懷感激
"Be grateful for the rocks life rolls in your path,

99
00:03:39,634 --> 00:03:42,484
因為有一天 你會視它們為墊腳石"
for one day, you'll see them as stepping stones."

100
00:03:43,140 --> 00:03:44,840
這句是從"可能要用"那堆里拿來的
I had that in my "maybe" pile.

101
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,100
相信自己啊 杰
Trust yourself, Jay.

102
00:03:48,364 --> 00:03:50,553
老天 是學校發來的郵件
Oh, God. It's an e-mail from school.

103
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,480
我可沒法在眾人面前看這郵件
I don't think I can read this in front of people.

104
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:55,360
加油 喬
Let's go, Joe!

105
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:07,600
我成功了
I did it!

106
00:04:08,512 --> 00:04:10,212
我成功了 好棒
I did it! Yes!

107
00:04:18,540 --> 00:04:21,020
我媽是不是收買了羅恩老師
Did my mom bribe Sensei Ron?

108
00:04:22,781 --> 00:04:24,181
我就知道你能做到 喬
I knew you could do it, Joe!

109
00:04:24,181 --> 00:04:25,521
母親的直覺告訴我
My mother's intuition told me

110
00:04:25,521 --> 00:04:27,771
你沒什么好擔心的
that you had nothing to worry about.

111
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:31,880
如果她收買了羅恩老師 那她還收買了誰呢
And if she bribed Sensei Ron, who else did she bribe?

112
00:04:32,380 --> 00:04:33,960
這個獎杯也是我應得的嗎
Did I even deserve this?

113
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:37,440
你還記得逛超市很無聊的時候嗎
Do you remember when grocery shopping was boring?

114
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:39,300
不記得
I really don't.

115
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,140
身為家長 很少有機會獲得
As a parent, you don't get

116
00:04:42,140 --> 00:04:44,500
美妙 磊落 沒愧疚感的勝利
a lot of good, clean, guilt-free victories.

117
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,480
所以我們今天
That's why it's hard not to feel

118
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,720
很難不感到自信滿滿
pretty damn good about ourselves today.

119
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:49,820
因為今天下午
Because this afternoon,

120
00:04:49,820 --> 00:04:52,820
我們要看咱家女兒艾麗克斯畢業
we are going to watch our daughter Alex graduate...

121
00:04:52,820 --> 00:04:53,720
是以優異成績哦
With honors!

122
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,800
從世界知名的加州理工大學
...from the world-renowned Caltech.

123
00:04:56,089 --> 00:04:58,949
? 當你對陣加州理工海貍隊時 ?
♪ When the Caltech Beavers face you at sports ♪

124
00:04:58,949 --> 00:05:02,169
? 準備好讓出手里的球吧 ?
♪ Prepare to relinquish the ba-a-all ♪

125
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:04,540
他們雖然聰明 但沒把心思放在寫隊歌上
Their best minds weren't focused on the fight song.

126
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:04,960
沒錯
Yeah.

127
00:05:06,209 --> 00:05:07,619
我沒辦法停止微笑
I just can't stop smiling

128
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:09,980
一看到艾麗克斯這張穿戴著方帽和長袍的照片
at this picture of Alex in her cap and gown.

129
00:05:10,060 --> 00:05:12,080
真是不敢相信 我跟你的孩子
It's so surreal that one of our kids

130
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:14,420
居然能獲得如此高的成就
could do something so amazing.

131
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:15,280
我也愛你們兩個哦
I love you both.

132
00:05:15,918 --> 00:05:18,208
你們倆去拿香檳和鮮花送給艾麗克斯
So, you two, grab champagne and flowers for Alex.

133
00:05:18,208 --> 00:05:21,038
我們...我們去拿雪茄送給杰
We'll, uh -- We'll get some cigars to give to Jay.

134
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:21,800
行
Yeah.

135
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,320
天啊
Oh, my God.

136
00:05:24,568 --> 00:05:27,497
是斯基普·伍斯南 他炒掉你之后你見過他嗎
It's Skip Woosnam. Have you seen him since he fired you?

137
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,180
見過一次 在賣房會上
Once, at a listing.

138
00:05:29,987 --> 00:05:32,387
我試圖假扮成我自己的3D紙板
I tried to pretend I was a 3D cutout of myself

139
00:05:32,387 --> 00:05:33,577
避免跟他說話
to avoid talking to him.

140
00:05:33,577 --> 00:05:35,647
不過今天我倒想跟他聊聊
But you know what? Today I want to talk to him.

141
00:05:36,017 --> 00:05:37,247
我想我要告訴老斯基普
I think I'll let ol' Skip know

142
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:39,520
我女兒要從加州理工畢業了
I have a daughter graduating from Caltech.

143
00:05:39,740 --> 00:05:41,540
不 親愛的 我們不是那種
No, honey, we are not the kind of parents

144
00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:44,060
靠炫耀孩子來給自己長臉的家長
who make ourselves look good by bragging about our kids.

145
00:05:44,156 --> 00:05:46,156
那我們為什么要生孩子 克萊爾
Then why did we even have them, Claire?

146
00:05:46,256 --> 00:05:47,516
我們連自鳴得意一下都不行嗎
Are we really not gonna crow about it

147
00:05:47,540 --> 00:05:49,440
我們終于有個孩子做了能讓我們驕傲的事
when one of our kids finally does something we can be proud of?

148
00:05:49,500 --> 00:05:50,620
我好愛你們兩個
I love you both very much.

149
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:52,400
我不介意做帥氣性感的那個孩子
I'm comfortable being the hot one.

150
00:05:57,140 --> 00:05:58,500
這個月又創紀錄了
Another record month?

151
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,340
謝謝
Well, thank you!

152
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:02,220
你是世界上最優秀的管家
You're the greatest butler on Earth.

153
00:06:02,915 --> 00:06:03,775
我得掛了
I gotta run.

154
00:06:03,775 --> 00:06:05,336
-菲爾 -斯基普
- Phil? - Skip!

155
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,440
你這家伙 最近好嗎
You son of a gun. How the hell are you?

156
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,580
很好 很好 生意比以往更紅火
Great, great. Business is better than ever.

157
00:06:09,820 --> 00:06:10,620
你怎么樣
How about you?

158
00:06:10,865 --> 00:06:13,165
你現在買真的人形立牌了嗎
Did you, uh, finally get real cutouts?

159
00:06:13,165 --> 00:06:14,205
我不知道你在說什么
I don't know what you're talking about.

160
00:06:14,205 --> 00:06:15,555
我的立牌都是3D高仿真的
Mine are so realistic and 3D,

161
00:06:15,555 --> 00:06:17,094
你肯定像白癡一樣對著它笑來著
you must have been laughing at one of them like an idiot.

162
00:06:17,094 --> 00:06:19,464
我們購物時撞見彼此真是太巧了
How crazy is it we ran into each other shopping, huh?

163
00:06:19,464 --> 00:06:21,364
對了 你的孩子們還好嗎
Say, how are your kids?

164
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:22,380
都特別好
Terrific. Yeah.

165
00:06:22,494 --> 00:06:25,024
瓊剛找到份康泰納連鎖店的工作
June just, uh, took a job at the Container Store.

166
00:06:25,024 --> 00:06:25,934
真厲害 我也有個孩子
Impressive. I have a kid

167
00:06:25,934 --> 00:06:27,384
對太空特別感興趣
that's interested in space, as well. Yeah.

168
00:06:27,384 --> 00:06:30,684
其實她在考慮去太空總署工作
Considering a job at, uh -- at NASA, actually.

169
00:06:30,684 --> 00:06:33,893
是啊 他看起來很有這方面天賦
Yeah, he, uh, looks like he's got the right stuff.

170
00:06:34,643 --> 00:06:36,683
不 我說的是我女兒
No, I -- it's -- I was talking about my daughter.

171
00:06:36,683 --> 00:06:38,523
爸 你猜怎么著
Oh. Hey, Dad. Dad, guess what.

172
00:06:38,523 --> 00:06:41,353
我一拿起酒瓶雙胞胎就開始亂踢
The twins started kicking the second I picked up booze.

173
00:06:41,740 --> 00:06:43,180
絕對是我的孩子 對吧
They're my kids, right?

174
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:44,480
我的另一個女兒
My other daughter.

175
00:06:48,752 --> 00:06:50,282
那好 我的演講里
Okay, I'm doing a little thing about

176
00:06:50,282 --> 00:06:52,042
會稍微說說追隨夢想
following your dreams in mine.

177
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,300
你的演講里有嗎
Do you have anything like that in yours?

178
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,960
我的是"追隨熱情"
I say "Follow your passions."

179
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:56,320
好的 不算重復
Okay, yeah. That's different enough.

180
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:58,320
好吧
Okay.

181
00:06:58,320 --> 00:07:00,100
那邊有點可疑
Something fishy's going on over here.

182
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:02,200
我去旁敲側擊一下 看看能查出什么
I'm gonna go shake some trees, see what falls.

183
00:07:03,852 --> 00:07:06,061
你今天真精神 副校長塔克
Looking lovely today, Vice Principal Tucker.

184
00:07:06,061 --> 00:07:08,101
別裝純良少年了 平托斯基
Cut the choirboy act, Pitkowski.

185
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,860
你不喜歡我用這種方式對你說話嗎
Oh, you don't like the way I'm talking to you?

186
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:11,120
你能跟誰投訴去
Well, who are you gonna complain to?

187
00:07:11,380 --> 00:07:12,100
沒人
No one!

188
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:14,160
因為我是代理校長
Because I'm the acting principal,

189
00:07:14,300 --> 00:07:15,980
執掌無上大權
clothed in immense power!

190
00:07:18,181 --> 00:07:19,731
等等 這是什么 休想
Wait, what is -- Nope!

191
00:07:20,361 --> 00:07:21,580
我彎腰速度更快
I bend faster.

192
00:07:21,580 --> 00:07:22,975
"杰·普里契特 貓頭鷹殺手"
"Jay Pritchett, Owl Killer"?!

193
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,000
這是什么鬼東西
What the hell is this?

194
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:26,960
那是1972年
The year was 1972.

195
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:28,800
我接到了超級大單
I landed a whale --

196
00:07:29,340 --> 00:07:31,400
一艘嘉年華游輪上的所有衣柜
every closet on a Carnival Cruise ship.

197
00:07:31,500 --> 00:07:32,700
為了預算和工期合得上
To make the numbers work,

198
00:07:32,820 --> 00:07:35,080
我需要快速搞到一大批廉價雪松木
I needed a lot of cedar fast and cheap.

199
00:07:35,780 --> 00:07:37,160
結果我砍伐的一片森林
I ended up cutting down a forest

200
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:40,300
剛好是金斑貓頭鷹最后的棲息地
that happened to be the last habitat of the Golden Speckled Owl.

201
00:07:41,260 --> 00:07:43,800
怎么沒人提我這一舉救下了多少老鼠
You know, nobody talks about all the mice I saved.

202
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:44,600
沒人提
Nope!

203
00:07:45,420 --> 00:07:46,460
只提貓頭鷹
Just the owls.

204
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,700
你們在計劃抗議嗎
Are you all planning some sort of protest?

205
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:50,700
在我的監管下 休想
Well, that ain't happening on my watch.

206
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,040
快去坐好
Now go take your seats!

207
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:53,660
"貓頭鷹希特勒"
"Owl Hitler"?!

208
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:57,360
這照片是怎么回事 我從沒勒死過貓頭鷹
What the hell is this picture? I never strangled an owl!

209
00:07:58,340 --> 00:08:00,480
讓迪蘭告訴我他人在哪很過分嗎
Is it too much for Dylan to let me know where he is?

210
00:08:00,540 --> 00:08:02,420
我的羊水隨時會破
My water could literally break any minute.

211
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,940
我坐在這沒問題吧
Am I okay sitting here,

212
00:08:03,948 --> 00:08:06,628
還是說像海洋世界前排一樣會被濺濕
or am I in a SeaWorld splash zone situation?

213
00:08:06,628 --> 00:08:09,508
克萊爾 你高中時的死敵艾希莉·沃爾斯
Claire, your old high school nemesis Ashley Walls,

214
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:10,260
她不是有個女兒嗎
did she have a daughter?

215
00:08:10,660 --> 00:08:11,740
我記得沒有 怎么了
Uh, I don't think so. Why?

216
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:13,020
那邊那個女人
Well, that woman over there

217
00:08:13,020 --> 00:08:14,380
看起來很像艾希莉 但不太可能
looks just like Ashley, but it can't be.

218
00:08:14,380 --> 00:08:15,860
她看起來只有你一半 美貌
She looks half your... beauty.

219
00:08:18,380 --> 00:08:19,100
艾希莉·沃爾斯
Ashley Walls.

220
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,200
她在每件事上都勝過我
She outdid me at everything.

221
00:08:21,700 --> 00:08:24,260
返校節女王 曲棍球隊長
Homecoming Queen, Field Hockey Captain,

222
00:08:24,260 --> 00:08:26,200
我們上大學前的那個夏天
and the summer before we went away to college,

223
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:29,180
她竟打敗我成為了普里契特衣柜的實習生
she beat me out for an internship at Pritchett's closets.

224
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:30,960
克萊爾
Claire?

225
00:08:32,620 --> 00:08:34,280
讓我想想
I...want to say...

226
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:34,980
艾希莉
Ashley?

227
00:08:35,196 --> 00:08:37,956
-是我 你好嗎 -很好
- Yes! how are you? - Good.

228
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,460
艾希莉·沃爾斯-卡內基
Ashley Walls-Carnegie.

229
00:08:39,606 --> 00:08:41,136
菲利普·漢弗萊·鄧菲
Phillip Humphrey Dunphy.

230
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:42,880
你最近在忙什么 艾希莉
So, what have you been up to, Ashley?

231
00:08:43,445 --> 00:08:45,555
我是人身傷害律師
Uh, well, I'm a personal injury lawyer.

232
00:08:45,555 --> 00:08:47,705
我有個兄弟靠這個賺了好多錢
I have a buddy that makes bank from that.

233
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,040
他不是律師
He's not a lawyer.

234
00:08:49,100 --> 00:08:50,740
他專門挑豪車碰瓷
He just tries to get nice cars to hit him.

235
00:08:50,955 --> 00:08:52,275
他只是在開玩笑
Yeah, he's just kidding.

236
00:08:52,420 --> 00:08:53,380
我沒開玩笑 媽
No, I'm not, Mom.

237
00:08:53,635 --> 00:08:55,176
-事實上 我 -給 吃塊糖
- In fact, I've ac-- - Here, have a candy.

238
00:08:55,380 --> 00:08:56,180
真無禮
That was rude.

239
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,880
我剛剛遇到了以前的健康教育老師
I just ran into my old health teacher,

240
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:59,200
她說她一直都覺得
and she said she always expected

241
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,540
我會挺著大肚子參加畢業典禮
to see me pregnant at graduation.

242
00:09:01,700 --> 00:09:02,140
恭喜
Congratulations.

243
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:04,020
謝謝 是雙胞胎
Oh, thanks. Twins.

244
00:09:04,340 --> 00:09:05,920
抱歉 要是知道他們老爸現在在哪
Sorry, I'd be a lot happier about it

245
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,260
我會開心得多
if I could track their father down.

246
00:09:07,580 --> 00:09:07,960
吃糖
Candy.

247
00:09:08,540 --> 00:09:10,620
看 是你弟弟米奇
Oh, look -- it's your brother, Mitch.

248
00:09:10,620 --> 00:09:12,920
他總是一板一眼的 對不對
Now, he was always a little uptight, wasn't he?

249
00:09:13,144 --> 00:09:15,494
高中時是的 但現在他特別好...
Well, he was in high school, but now he's just the most --

250
00:09:15,494 --> 00:09:16,843
聽好 你今天只有一個任務 小姑娘
Okay, you have one job today, young lady,

251
00:09:16,843 --> 00:09:17,963
支持你大爸
okay, to be supportive.

252
00:09:17,963 --> 00:09:19,413
假如他說了笑話 你就要笑
If your dad makes a joke, you will laugh.

253
00:09:19,420 --> 00:09:21,260
他演講后你怎么做 鼓掌
If he makes a speech, you will what? Applaud.

254
00:09:21,743 --> 00:09:23,743
好吧 我得去找我的座位了
Right. I-I-I'm gonna go find my seat.

255
00:09:23,743 --> 00:09:26,133
但和你敘舊真開心 克萊爾
But it was great catching up with you, Claire.

256
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:30,180
提一嘴我們女兒今天要從加州理工畢業
No one would blame you if you mentioned you had a daughter

257
00:09:30,180 --> 00:09:31,800
誰也不會責怪你的
graduating from Caltech today.

258
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:34,220
親愛的 錯過時機了
Honey, the moment has passed.

259
00:09:34,462 --> 00:09:37,992
我得有個好理由才能不經意地過去
I'd need a pretty good reason to just go waltzing over there --

260
00:09:38,152 --> 00:09:39,670
-她的流程單掉了 -太好了
- She dropped her program! - Yes!

261
00:09:39,752 --> 00:09:42,022
克萊爾 你知道我有事會第一個找你商量
Hey, Claire, you know how you're my go-to gal --

262
00:09:42,022 --> 00:09:43,612
-我很忙 -菲爾
- Busy. - Hey, Phil.

263
00:09:43,612 --> 00:09:46,312
你知道我有事會第一個找你商量
You know how you're my go-to guy on stuff?

264
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:49,700
看來我們戰勝所有不可能成為了摯友
I suppose against all odds, we've become best friends.

265
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:50,240
是啊
Sure.

266
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:54,040
很明顯 由我來做畢業演講
So, apparently, some of the students are angry

267
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:55,600
讓一些學生很生氣
that I'm giving the commencement address.

268
00:09:55,760 --> 00:09:56,080
為什么
Why?

269
00:09:56,300 --> 00:09:58,240
誰知道他們扭曲的腦子是怎么想的
Who knows why their sick minds do anything?

270
00:09:58,540 --> 00:10:00,820
不過我得說 能再次憎恨嬉皮士感覺很好
Gotta say though, it feels good to be hating hippies again.

271
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:03,160
總之 你能不能幫我巡視一下這地方
Anyway, would you mind giving this place a sweep?

272
00:10:03,620 --> 00:10:05,260
看看有沒有什么可疑的
See if you notice something suspicious.

273
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:06,840
這就辦好
Consider it done.

274
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:09,820
你們把什么藏起來了
Hey. What do you got there?

275
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:12,040
讓我看看你們的袍子下藏著什么
You kids got something under those robes you want to show me?

276
00:10:13,220 --> 00:10:15,940
曼尼 你沒被裁掉
Manny, you passed the cuts,

277
00:10:15,940 --> 00:10:17,840
為什么心情還這么不好
so why aren't you in a better mood?

278
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:22,680
你賄賂了我的院長讓我通過的 是不是
You bribed my dean to get me past the cut, didn't you?

279
00:10:22,820 --> 00:10:25,080
我永遠不會做那種事
I would never do something like that.

280
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:26,420
真厲害
Oh, bravo!

281
00:10:26,660 --> 00:10:28,680
假如麗莎·瓦格納有你演技這么好
If Lisa Wagner pulled out that performance,

282
00:10:28,820 --> 00:10:30,740
也許她就不會帶著裝滿手工木偶的卡車
maybe she wouldn't be driving back to her parents' house

283
00:10:30,740 --> 00:10:32,200
和突然迷茫的未來
with a trunk full of handmade puppets

284
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:34,080
開車回到父母家了
and a suddenly very uncertain future.

285
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:35,280
我才沒有賄賂誰
I didn't bribe anyone.

286
00:10:35,380 --> 00:10:37,560
我也不知道你怎么會問這種問題
I don't know why you're talking such crazy things.

287
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:39,680
因為我看見你賄賂羅恩老師了
Because I saw you bribe Sensei Ron.

288
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,300
等等
Wait.

289
00:10:41,588 --> 00:10:43,415
你賄賂羅恩老師了
You bribed Sensei Ron?!

290
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:45,600
所以這一切都是個謊言
So this is just a lie?!

291
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:46,980
還有別的誰嗎
Are there others?

292
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:49,120
我到底算什么人啊
Who the hell even am I?!

293
00:11:02,060 --> 00:11:03,040
我的天
Oh, my God!

294
00:11:06,807 --> 00:11:08,517
想跑可沒門 小朋友
Nice try, kemosabes.

295
00:11:21,706 --> 00:11:23,896
艾希 你節目單掉了
Ash. I think you left your program.

296
00:11:24,256 --> 00:11:25,027
謝謝
Thank you.

297
00:11:25,396 --> 00:11:26,496
想想這些孩子最后
Wow, it's wild to think

298
00:11:26,496 --> 00:11:28,155
光明的前途 真是感慨萬千啊 是吧
where all these kids are gonna end up, right?

299
00:11:28,155 --> 00:11:30,425
我說 有那么多好學校
I mean, there's so many great schools.

300
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:31,820
其實 我們的
In fact, our --

301
00:11:32,540 --> 00:11:33,520
你還好嗎
Is something wrong?

302
00:11:35,140 --> 00:11:36,360
我們女兒加入恐怖組織了
Our daughter joined ISIS.

303
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:40,220
美國政府不承認她的公民身份了
The government said she's not an American anymore.

304
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:42,940
現在我們家門前總是停著一輛貨車
There's a van always parked in front of our house.

305
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,440
天啊 我很難過
Oh, God. I'm so sorry --

306
00:11:44,454 --> 00:11:47,074
克萊爾有沒有說我們的女兒是個天才呀
Did Claire tell you our daughter's a genius?

307
00:11:47,860 --> 00:11:50,180
那么接下來 畢業生們 看看你們的左邊
...and so, graduates, look to your left

308
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:51,860
再看看右邊
and to your right.

309
00:11:52,344 --> 00:11:55,324
我丟了個小牛仔帽裝飾的簡潔大方的鑰匙鏈
It's a simple key chain with a tiny cowboy hat charm on it.

310
00:11:55,380 --> 00:11:56,720
誰撿到了 請傳上來
If you see it, please pass it forward.

311
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:59,260
好了 現在有請我們的畢業演講嘉賓
All right, and now on to our commencement speaker.

312
00:11:59,260 --> 00:12:01,380
他是社會的棟梁
He is a pillar of the community,

313
00:12:01,503 --> 00:12:04,833
企業家 行業巨頭 杰·普里契特先生
an entrepreneur and closeteer -- Mr. Jay Pritchett.

314
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,140
畢業典禮
Commencement.

315
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,740
"C"代表著"勇氣"
"C" for "Courage,"

316
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:12,760
"O"代表著"機遇"
"O" for "Opportunity,"

317
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:15,260
第一個"M"
the first "M" --

318
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:20,520
災難來臨了
Disaster had struck.

319
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:21,760
但是我慌了嗎
But did I panic?

320
00:12:22,280 --> 00:12:22,660
沒有
No.

321
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:25,440
沒人主動選擇成為戰時的校長
No one chooses to be a wartime principal.

322
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:27,460
但我們終將被歷史所銘記
But we're the ones history remembers.

323
00:12:28,220 --> 00:12:30,360
二選其一 他們都說
Pick one, they all said --

324
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:32,300
壁櫥還是百葉窗
closets or blinds.

325
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:35,200
米奇爾 這要毀了畢業典禮的
Mitchell, he's tanking my graduation.

326
00:12:35,261 --> 00:12:37,491
我打算跳過他 直接進入懷念校友環節
I'm cutting him off and moving right to the in-memoriam section.

327
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:38,800
那聽起來真是令人"愉快"啊
Well, that would be less depressing.

328
00:12:39,100 --> 00:12:41,700
是是 問題是樂隊的人剛剛走得一個不剩了
Yeah, the problem is, the band just walked out in solidarity.

329
00:12:41,981 --> 00:12:43,601
-給你 -干什么
- Here. - W-What?

330
00:12:43,660 --> 00:12:46,260
米奇爾 紀念儀式不能沒有音樂
Mitchell, you can't have an in memoriam without music.

331
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:47,360
那太掃興了
That's just a bummer.

332
00:12:48,220 --> 00:12:48,680
拿著
Take it!

333
00:12:49,460 --> 00:12:52,630
你們愛怎么咕咕叫怎么叫 反正我最后成功了
Hoot all you want, but that Brylcreem kid was me!

334
00:12:52,630 --> 00:12:53,570
是的 謝謝你
Yes, hi, thank you.

335
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:55,600
謝謝你 杰·普里契特 大家鼓掌
Thank you, Jay Pritchett, everyone!

336
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:57,020
我不知道你們什么感覺 不過我覺得
Wow, I don't know about you, but I feel like

337
00:12:57,020 --> 00:12:58,780
自己視野大開 要走向世界了啊
getting out there and taking on the world, huh?

338
00:12:59,260 --> 00:13:00,760
現在 讓我們銘記
And now, let's remember

339
00:13:00,760 --> 00:13:02,780
今年我們失去的那些友人
those Dolphins we lost this year.

340
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:05,100
米奇爾 快吹起來 什么都行
Mitchell, play something. Play anything.

341
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,760
吹點特別莊重特別深沉的
Something with the most gravitas.

342
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:12,580
你知道嗎 我這么一個兩年沒碰過小號的人
You know, for a person who last touched a trumpet two years ago,

343
00:13:13,140 --> 00:13:14,580
吹得還挺好的
I think I sounded pretty good.

344
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:26,680
吹完了 吹完了
I'm done. I'm done.

345
00:13:27,300 --> 00:13:28,020
好了
All right!

346
00:13:28,420 --> 00:13:30,920
這一年逝去的人真是多啊
That is a lot of deceased for one year.

347
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:32,940
我們可能要報給警察調查一下了
We should probably have the police check into that.

348
00:13:33,158 --> 00:13:35,708
現在 在授予學位證書之前
And now, before, uh, passing out diplomas,

349
00:13:35,708 --> 00:13:37,329
我想為畢業班的同學
I would like to make sort of a --

350
00:13:37,757 --> 00:13:40,317
致以一些個人的表示
a personal gesture to this graduating class.

351
00:13:40,317 --> 00:13:43,867
當氣球飛向天空 你們會發現每一個
As these balloons fill the sky, know that each one of them

352
00:13:43,867 --> 00:13:47,747
都代表著一個親身鼓舞了我
represents a student who has personally inspired me

353
00:13:47,820 --> 00:13:50,980
讓我對未來充滿美好希望的學生
and filled me with hope for a better tomorrow.

354
00:13:57,620 --> 00:13:58,020
什么情況
What?

355
00:14:01,856 --> 00:14:02,717
代理校長
Acting Principal!

356
00:14:03,380 --> 00:14:04,920
抗議者們黑進了我們的灑水系統
Protesters hacked into our sprinkler system.

357
00:14:05,220 --> 00:14:06,280
五分鐘之后就要啟動了
It's set to go off in five minutes.

358
00:14:06,680 --> 00:14:07,760
我們得推遲畢業典禮
We have to postpone the graduation.

359
00:14:07,940 --> 00:14:09,360
然后錯過我成為校長的機會嗎
And miss my chance of becoming principal?

360
00:14:09,540 --> 00:14:10,100
沒門
Not a chance!

361
00:14:10,180 --> 00:14:11,940
但是沒人能在五分鐘之內念完四百個名字
Well, no one can read 400 names in five minutes.

362
00:14:11,940 --> 00:14:12,340
是嗎
Oh, really?

363
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:15,960
所有訓練 所有錯過的派對
All that training, all those parties missed,

364
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,040
所有那些參加過的拍賣會
all those auctions attended

365
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:19,000
都是為了此時此刻
were for this moment right here, right now.

366
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:20,960
同學們 你們好 當你們聽到你們名字的時候
Students, hi! When you hear your name,

367
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:23,500
請走上臺來 拿走你們的學位證書
please proceed to the stage and grab your diploma.

368
00:14:24,405 --> 00:14:25,655
奈莉·阿布瑞莎米 艾莉森·阿科斯塔
Nelly Abrishami, Allison Acosta,

369
00:14:25,655 --> 00:14:28,044
弗里達·阿拉法利 斯科特·"討厭鬼"·阿爾巴內塞
Frieda Alafary, Scott "The Skunk" Albanese,

370
00:14:28,044 --> 00:14:29,554
杰西卡·埃倫尼克 理查德·湯普森·艾倫
Jessica Alenick, Richard Thompson Allen,

371
00:14:29,554 --> 00:14:31,034
拉瓦利亞·阿米努 拉里·阿納科恩
Lavaria Aminu, Larry Annecone,

372
00:14:31,034 --> 00:14:33,534
達拉·阿爾勒特 丹尼爾·戴伊·阿倫森
Darla Arleto, Daniel Dey Aronson...

373
00:14:33,534 --> 00:14:34,835
我本來可以念完的
I was gonna make it!

374
00:14:34,954 --> 00:14:35,865
然后
And then...

375
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:37,560
我遇到了波蘭名字
I hit the Polish names.

376
00:14:38,084 --> 00:14:42,174
切斯沃夫·沃拉德瑞扎克科沃斯基
Czeslaw Wlodaryzack-ck-kowsky.

377
00:14:42,204 --> 00:14:44,793
沃洛迪斯勞·沃勞德
Wladyslaw Wlod...

378
00:14:44,793 --> 00:14:46,254
尼斯基 對
nisky? Yeah.

379
00:14:47,343 --> 00:14:49,033
邁拉·扎林斯基
Myra Zarinsky --

380
00:14:52,443 --> 00:14:54,084
好了 快撤快撤
OK, all right, all right

381
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:58,560
如果我們離爸爸和小卡遠一點 可能還有機會
Okay, if we steer clear of Dad and Cam, we've got a chance

382
00:14:58,560 --> 00:15:00,260
在這堆暴民動武的時候混進他們人群不被打
of blending into the mob when they turn violent.

383
00:15:00,500 --> 00:15:01,620
這是什么情況
What the hell is this?

384
00:15:01,892 --> 00:15:03,202
是這樣的 顯然 為貓頭鷹抗議的人
Okay, well, apparently, when those owls

385
00:15:03,202 --> 00:15:05,042
黑進灑水系統 是影響全校區的
hacked into the sprinkler system, it was school-wide.

386
00:15:05,042 --> 00:15:07,472
他們不讓任何人進停車場
They're not letting anyone into the parking structure.

387
00:15:07,472 --> 00:15:08,383
不是吧
Oh, no!

388
00:15:08,460 --> 00:15:10,200
我希望這不會讓我們錯過
I hope this doesn't mean we're gonna have to miss

389
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:12,060
今天的第二個畢業典禮
the second graduation of the day.

390
00:15:14,740 --> 00:15:16,060
運氣真好
How lucky is that?

391
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:18,820
我正拉著優步訂單 你們就打過電話來了
Me cruising by with an Uber fare right when you called.

392
00:15:19,681 --> 00:15:21,491
-幸運幸運 -真好
- So lucky. Very lucky. - Very good.

393
00:15:21,491 --> 00:15:23,021
你到了 杰拉爾德
Well, this is you, Gerald.

394
00:15:25,660 --> 00:15:27,080
希望今天開始你能
Let's have today be the day

395
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:28,320
不再是為了你父親演奏
you stop playing for your dad

396
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,680
而是為自己演奏
and start playing for Gerald.

397
00:15:30,551 --> 00:15:31,911
話說 這提醒了我
That -- That kind of reminds me --

398
00:15:31,911 --> 00:15:34,040
對不起 我騙你說自己上了小號課
I'm sorry I lied about the trumpet lessons.

399
00:15:34,040 --> 00:15:35,130
沒事 這才不是我今天最倒霉的部分
Oh, please. Not the worst part of my day.

400
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:37,840
我現在想明白了布朗校長是故意坑我讓我失敗
I'm realizing now that Principal Brown set me up to fail.

401
00:15:37,920 --> 00:15:38,920
根本沒有什么車禍
There was no car crash,

402
00:15:38,940 --> 00:15:40,140
跟登月一樣都是騙人的
just like there was no moon landing.

403
00:15:40,190 --> 00:15:42,230
-小卡 -太空里旗幟是不會飄揚的 米奇爾
- Cam - Flags can't wave in space, Mitchell.

404
00:15:42,230 --> 00:15:44,580
好了好了 我被羞辱得比你們都過分
Hey, hey, hey, I was humiliated much worse than you.

405
00:15:44,660 --> 00:15:45,320
太不公平了
It was so unfair.

406
00:15:45,740 --> 00:15:47,590
兢兢業業一輩子最后無人贊譽
A lifetime of service out the window.

407
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:49,660
你們以為我每晚閉上眼睛
You think I don't see the faces of owls

408
00:15:49,660 --> 00:15:51,900
不會看到那些貓頭鷹的臉嗎
every night I close my eyes?

409
00:15:52,140 --> 00:15:54,780
至少你有大家心服口服的成就
At least you've accomplished something they can tear down.

410
00:15:54,959 --> 00:15:56,240
我是個騙子
I'm a fraud!

411
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:57,680
你看到你對你弟弟做了什么嗎
You see what you did to your brother?

412
00:15:57,889 --> 00:16:00,279
看那難過又受傷的大眼睛
Look at those sad, hurt eyes.

413
00:16:00,279 --> 00:16:01,459
就像難過的小貓頭鷹
Like a sad little owl.

414
00:16:01,459 --> 00:16:02,789
也許要是你相信自己的兒子
Well, maybe if you believed in your sons

415
00:16:02,789 --> 00:16:04,809
而不是跟每個人都來哥倫比亞式握手
instead of giving everyone Colombian handshakes.

416
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:05,200
什么
What?!

417
00:16:05,230 --> 00:16:07,978
我可從來沒有當著哪個男人家室的面
I've never sanded down a man's fingers

418
00:16:07,980 --> 00:16:09,380
跟他親密握手
in front of his family!

419
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:12,380
你是說賄賂的事啊
Oh, you mean the bribes?

420
00:16:12,540 --> 00:16:13,720
你沒法否認了
You can't deny it anymore.

421
00:16:13,940 --> 00:16:15,580
看我們院長發出來的照片
Look at this photo on my dean's Instagram.

422
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:17,760
他戴著的表跟你給羅恩老師的一模一樣
He's wearing the same watch you gave Sensei Ron.

423
00:16:17,880 --> 00:16:19,280
地區教育局長也戴著一樣的表
The superintendent was wearing that same watch.

424
00:16:19,288 --> 00:16:21,337
典禮結束后他跟我握手
I-I noticed it when he shook my hand at the end of the ceremony

425
00:16:21,337 --> 00:16:23,017
他說我"滑天下之大稽"時 我有注意到
and said I was a "Horrifying disgrace."

426
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:24,140
你賄賂他了嗎
You bribed him?!

427
00:16:24,700 --> 00:16:26,100
是因為這樣我才有資格演說的嗎
Is that how I got my speech?

428
00:16:27,060 --> 00:16:27,960
好了 夠了
Okay, enough!

429
00:16:28,300 --> 00:16:31,360
我相信你們憑自己也能做到
I'm sure you would have gotten all these things on your own,

430
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:34,680
但世界有時就是那么不公平
but the world sometimes is very unfair!

431
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:37,080
那些手表只是以防萬一啦
And the watches are like an insurance.

432
00:16:37,420 --> 00:16:38,560
你為什么會有那么多啊
Why do you even have so many?

433
00:16:38,796 --> 00:16:41,556
有時候我吃安眠藥后會夢游網購
Sometimes I do a little bit of Ambien shopping

434
00:16:41,556 --> 00:16:43,646
然后把同樣的東西買一堆
and I buy too much of one thing.

435
00:16:43,940 --> 00:16:45,040
難道你們圣誕節
Didn't you all wonder

436
00:16:45,040 --> 00:16:47,460
收到一樣的有趣襪子時沒想過這事嗎
when you got the same fun socks for Christmas?

437
00:16:47,926 --> 00:16:49,156
-一樣的耶 -我了個去
- Oh, samesies. - I'll be damned!

438
00:16:49,156 --> 00:16:50,396
-我怎么沒收到 -可有趣了
- I don't have those. - They're fun!

439
00:16:50,396 --> 00:16:51,366
對不起 是我不好
I'm sorry, okay?

440
00:16:51,380 --> 00:16:53,160
但我太愛你們了
But I love you guys so much

441
00:16:53,436 --> 00:16:55,815
我不想把你們的愿望交給命運來安排
to leave your dreams to chance.

442
00:16:56,160 --> 00:16:57,640
我想在你長大的故鄉
I suppose where you grew up,

443
00:16:57,640 --> 00:16:59,340
鉆漏洞也是生存的一部分
bending the rules was just a part of life.

444
00:16:59,820 --> 00:17:01,400
你必須得這樣才能活下去
It's what you had to do to get by.

445
00:17:01,940 --> 00:17:03,560
你又怎么會不拿來幫忙你愛的人呢
Why wouldn't you do that to help the people you love?

446
00:17:04,100 --> 00:17:05,020
謝謝你 曼尼
Thank you, Manny.

447
00:17:05,340 --> 00:17:06,900
你謝什么啊 我才不是那么覺得呢
You're not welcome. That's not how I feel.

448
00:17:06,965 --> 00:17:08,525
這是我演出的劇的臺詞
I-It's a speech from a play I was in.

449
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:09,420
在我說完剛才的臺詞后
Right after that line,

450
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:11,220
我點事后煙然后重新穿上我的衣服
I light up a cigarette and put my clothes back on.

451
00:17:11,700 --> 00:17:12,680
我是沒事啦 但是...
Yeah, I'm good, but...

452
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:14,540
我現在不知道我到底是不是憑實力了
now I'll never know if that's why I made the cut.

453
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:15,940
好了 別這樣 聽我說
Okay, stop. Look.

454
00:17:15,940 --> 00:17:17,660
大家今天都過了很慘的一天
We've all had a terrible day today --

455
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:18,420
我沒有啊
Not me.

456
00:17:18,494 --> 00:17:20,774
拉的客人都是大單 超贊的瑜伽課
Tons of great fares, amazing yoga class --

457
00:17:20,774 --> 00:17:22,614
我這邊在醞釀一個點呢 兄弟
I-I was building to something, buddy.

458
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:24,740
但是大家庭有這么一個好處
But that's one of the great things about being in a family.

459
00:17:24,860 --> 00:17:26,400
我們能分享其他人的勝利榮光
We get to share in each other's victories.

460
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:28,120
而艾麗克斯今天有一場大勝利
And Alex has a huge victory today

461
00:17:28,120 --> 00:17:29,500
能讓我們大家都感覺好受
that can make us all feel better.

462
00:17:29,600 --> 00:17:30,760
所以我們...
So let's...

463
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:33,040
把這糟糕的一天轉虧為盈 感覺美...
turn around this crap day with a nice, feel-good --

464
00:17:33,060 --> 00:17:34,140
那是艾麗克斯嗎
Hey, is that Alex?

465
00:17:35,340 --> 00:17:36,740
天啊 停車
Oh, my God. Pull over!

466
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:37,460
停
Back up!

467
00:17:40,780 --> 00:17:43,140
艾麗克斯 親愛的 怎么了 你還好嗎
Alex! Honey, what happened? Are you okay?

468
00:17:43,340 --> 00:17:44,260
今天周幾
What day is it?

469
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:47,620
無所謂 反正時間根本不會循環
Not that time is anything but a flat circle.

470
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:51,780
我們課都結束了 期末考也考完了
So...we were done with classes, done with finals,

471
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:54,400
就跟史上所有大四生一樣
and, like college seniors since the beginning of time,

472
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:56,500
我們也決定來瘋狂一把
we decided to get a little nuts.

473
00:17:57,500 --> 00:17:58,940
查格[干杯] 查格 查格 查格 查格
Chug! Chug! Chug! Chug! Chug!

474
00:17:58,940 --> 00:18:00,400
我們的同學阿施施·查格
Our classmate Ashish Chug...

475
00:18:00,581 --> 00:18:01,672
成功啦[喝完啦]
I did it!

476
00:18:01,771 --> 00:18:03,761
黑進了我們的出入證
...hacked his key card to get us access

477
00:18:03,761 --> 00:18:06,021
往里面加了進出圖書館限制區域的權限
to the restricted section of the library.

478
00:18:06,271 --> 00:18:08,561
我們決定去讀阿利斯特最后定理
We decided to read Alister's Last Theorem.

479
00:18:08,561 --> 00:18:12,931
哥特羅布·阿利斯特寫出了0=1的證明
Gottlob Alister wrote a proof showing that zero equals 1.

480
00:18:12,931 --> 00:18:14,531
這代表數學是無意義的
This rendered mathematics meaningless

481
00:18:14,531 --> 00:18:16,010
并且害他發了瘋
and drove him insane.

482
00:18:16,220 --> 00:18:18,720
根據傳說 同樣的命運降臨在了
According to legend, the same fate befalls anyone

483
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:21,080
每一個閱讀并能理解他證明的人身上
who reads and understands the proof.

484
00:18:21,180 --> 00:18:21,740
天啊
Good God.

485
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:31,000
如果數學沒有意義
If mathematics doesn't matter,

486
00:18:31,140 --> 00:18:32,340
那大家再也沒有任何確定的事物了
then no one can be certain of anything,

487
00:18:32,429 --> 00:18:33,939
而我浪費了我過去4...
and I've just wasted the last four --

488
00:18:33,939 --> 00:18:35,949
不對 是過去16年的人生
no, 16 years of my life,

489
00:18:36,020 --> 00:18:37,480
我畢業不畢業根本無所謂啊
and there's no point in me graduating!

490
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:39,660
我看得出來你非常不開心
Okay, I can tell that you're very upset,

491
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:41,900
你還可能因為期末考而累過頭
and you're probably really overtired from finals.

492
00:18:42,109 --> 00:18:44,969
但如果你不去參加畢業典禮 會后悔一生
But you are gonna regret it if you don't go to graduation.

493
00:18:44,969 --> 00:18:46,979
我跟你保證 無論你現在有什么煩心事
Look, I promise -- whatever is bothering you,

494
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:48,440
在典禮之后就會想通
figure it out after the ceremony --

495
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:49,540
-之后嗎 -是啊
- After?! - Yes.

496
00:18:49,660 --> 00:18:50,960
有"之后"就意味著有"之前"
"After" implies "before"!

497
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:53,540
但如果1分鐘之前等于0分鐘之前
But if one minute ago is the same as zero minutes ago,

498
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:55,400
那之前就是現在 而現在就是之后
then before is now and now is after!

499
00:18:55,648 --> 00:18:57,318
我通常聽到這種對白
Usually when I hear people talking like this,

500
00:18:57,318 --> 00:18:59,188
都是在聽到別人點餐在催上菜的時候
we're walking through a Taco Bell drive-through.

501
00:18:59,460 --> 00:19:01,980
親愛的 你有一半的人生都在被事物所震撼
Sweetie, half your life is having your mind blown.

502
00:19:02,038 --> 00:19:04,278
我還記得我第一次聽到原來銀河系中的星星
I remember when I heard there were more stars in the galaxy

503
00:19:04,278 --> 00:19:06,797
比一盒即時米飯里的米還多時的樣子
than grains of rice in a box of Uncle Ben's.

504
00:19:06,900 --> 00:19:08,340
不是的 是宇宙中的星系總數
No, there are more galaxies

505
00:19:08,340 --> 00:19:10,000
比世界上所有海灘中的沙加起來還多
than grains of sand on all the world's beaches.

506
00:19:12,087 --> 00:19:13,397
我不能一下失去他們兩個
Okay, I can't lose 'em both!

507
00:19:13,397 --> 00:19:15,117
-我來 艾麗克斯 -誰快來啊
- I got this! Alex... - Somebody?

508
00:19:15,420 --> 00:19:17,300
"我一直不知何為真正的力量 直到..."
"I never knew true strength until --"

509
00:19:17,300 --> 00:19:19,120
"我遇到一個沒有腳的人"
"I met a man with no feet."

510
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:21,260
等等 不是 這些卡沒按照順序擺
Wait. No. These cards are not in order.

511
00:19:21,260 --> 00:19:22,440
等等 你們不許跟我搶
Wait. Nobody help her right now --

512
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:25,300
艾麗克斯 你是個聰明又自信的女孩
Alex, you're a smart, confident girl.

513
00:19:26,066 --> 00:19:28,336
我知道你會做出正確的決定
I know that you're gonna make the right decision.

514
00:19:28,820 --> 00:19:30,580
你剛把這表戴我手上了嗎
Did you just put this watch on me?

515
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:32,340
我有病得治啊
I have a problem.

516
00:19:32,700 --> 00:19:34,780
我覺得如果艾麗克斯不想參加畢業典禮
I say if Alex doesn't want to go to her graduation,

517
00:19:34,780 --> 00:19:35,620
那她自己決定了就好
that's her decision.

518
00:19:36,180 --> 00:19:36,900
謝謝你 盧克
Thank you, Luke.

519
00:19:37,220 --> 00:19:38,340
只要你知道
As long as you know

520
00:19:38,340 --> 00:19:40,560
現在其實根本不是數學的問題就行
that whatever's going on here isn't about math.

521
00:19:40,760 --> 00:19:43,520
我覺得你只是在害怕離開校園
Yeah, I think maybe you're afraid to leave school.

522
00:19:43,655 --> 00:19:45,555
-什么 -你這輩子
- What? - Your whole life,

523
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:48,220
從小就知道你該做什么
you've always known exactly what you're supposed to do --

524
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:50,340
學習 得高分 反復
study, get good grades, repeat.

525
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:52,480
現在這要結束了 令你感到害怕
Now that's over, and it's scary.

526
00:19:52,855 --> 00:19:55,484
有點像是0=1
Kind of like if zero equalled 1.

527
00:19:55,680 --> 00:19:58,080
但你很幸運 你的傻子姐姐跟弟弟
But lucky for you, your dummy brother and sister

528
00:19:58,080 --> 00:19:59,400
在現實社會中都摸爬滾打過了
have spent time in the real world.

529
00:19:59,684 --> 00:20:02,524
如果我們都能站穩腳跟 你肯定沒問題
And if we can handle it, you're gonna do just fine.

530
00:20:03,660 --> 00:20:04,280
真的嗎
You think?

531
00:20:04,660 --> 00:20:05,560
相信我們
Trust us.

532
00:20:06,520 --> 00:20:08,580
走啦 我們帶你去畢業典禮吧
Come on. Let's go get you graduated.

533
00:20:09,654 --> 00:20:10,993
等等 那個門總卡住
Oh, hold on. That door gets jammed.

534
00:20:10,993 --> 00:20:12,503
我得從里面打開
I have to open it from the inside.

535
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:13,460
我來開
I got it!

536
00:20:16,860 --> 00:20:18,120
萊亨德·丹拿
Legend Danner.

537
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:21,840
致辭的事情我現在還是過不去
I still can't get over that commencement speech.

538
00:20:21,960 --> 00:20:22,860
完全沒人笑啊
Not a single laugh.

539
00:20:23,300 --> 00:20:25,700
我告訴你他沒發現什么元素吧 "笑"素
I'll tell you one element he didn't discover -- hilarium.

540
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:27,840
艾麗克斯·鄧菲
Alex Dunphy.

541
00:20:28,672 --> 00:20:29,773
恭喜你
Congratulations.

542
00:20:33,312 --> 00:20:35,172
我們也不想炫耀 但是...
We don't want to brag, but, uh...

543
00:20:35,290 --> 00:20:37,360
是我們的孩子們促成的
Our kids did that.

544
00:20:38,200 --> 00:20:38,740
是的
Yeah.

545
00:20:46,411 --> 00:20:48,561
別 別又是手表啊
No! No more watches.

546
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:50,400
我什么時候買的這些啊
When did I order these ones?

547
00:20:50,420 --> 00:20:51,800
媽 你猜怎么著
Hey mom, guess what?

548
00:20:54,340 --> 00:20:55,480
怎么啦 小寶貝
What? Papi.

549
00:20:55,820 --> 00:20:57,780
我朋友卡莉被踢出專業了
My friend Carly got cut from my program,

550
00:20:57,780 --> 00:21:00,080
她老爸最近還剛給戲服部門捐錢呢
and her dad's funded our new costume department.

551
00:21:00,460 --> 00:21:01,780
看來賄賂是沒用的
I guess bribes don't work.

552
00:21:01,860 --> 00:21:03,150
全是憑我的本事
I got through all my merit.

553
00:21:03,150 --> 00:21:04,840
-是啊 -這種時候就該獎賞自己
- Yeah!. - That calls for a reward.

554
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:07,660
這是什么
What is this?

555
00:21:07,730 --> 00:21:10,280
曼尼 求你別告訴杰
Manny, please don't tell Jay.

556
00:21:11,040 --> 00:21:12,940
燕麥葡萄干味啊 你知道嗎
Oatmeal raisin? You know what?

557
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:15,999
真正的藝術家不會阻止自己嘗試新體驗
A true artist doesn't close themselve off to new experiences.

558
00:21:15,999 --> 00:21:18,279
哪怕是看起來再不妙的餅干...
Even vile illlevan cookies.

559
00:21:18,279 --> 00:21:19,769
這就是我所選擇的人生道路
That's the path I've chosen.

560
00:21:19,769 --> 00:21:22,169
盡量去體驗并觀察人事物
To experiences and observe everything

561
00:21:22,169 --> 00:21:24,639
一起在這名為人生的美麗盛會上狂舞
in this beautiful pageant we called life.
